@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam stateBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam stateStartColor #163E52
skinparam stateEndColor #163E52
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 48
hide empty description
top to bottom direction

title SM-M07 — Actual submitted-set completeness
state "Recorded event; material\nset incomplete" as Incomplete
state "Capture under assessment" as Assessing
state "Actual required set\nconfirmed preserved" as Complete
state "Capture result unconfirmed" as Unknown
state "Required actual material\nunavailable" as Unavailable
[*] --> Incomplete : scoped initial context
Incomplete --> Assessing : SM-T036 capture requested\n[actual / permitted material]
Assessing --> Complete : SM-T037 complete capture confirmed\n[all required actual material]
Assessing --> Incomplete : SM-T038 missing / failed capture\n[definite incomplete result]
Assessing --> Unknown : SM-T039 confirmation ambiguous\n[unconfirmed result]
Unknown --> Complete : SM-T040 capture reconciled\n[complete evidence]
Unknown --> Incomplete : SM-T041 capture reconciled\n[incomplete evidence]
Complete --> Complete : SM-T042 source / live edited\n[independent live change]
Complete --> Unavailable : SM-T043 actual loss established\n[actual material missing]
Unavailable --> Complete : SM-T044 actual material restored\n[same actual material verified]
legend bottom
A: accepted core behavior; P: existing proposal; R: proposed refinement.
State labels are analysis abstractions, not implemented enums.
Transition tables define full actor, guard, effect and status.
Unconfirmed operation effects require SM-M18 reconciliation.
endlegend
@enduml
